 <h3><u>Aye zamin e ahoo</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>ahoo ki tarah..(2)<br> har ghadi zamin hai mera tu<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Bus isme ameeri o ghareebi ka nahi hai<br> tauheed ki manind mujhe iska yaqee hai<br> mash'had wahi jaata hai bulata hai jise tu<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Wallah wo ek lamhe me yusuf ko bhula de<br> angusht ke badle me wo sar apna kata de<br> miljae zulekha..(2) ko agar aapki khushboo<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Na sur ki samajh hai na kisi raag ki maula<br> sab hai teri dehleez ke zarro ka ye sadqa<br> kehte hai ye sab hai meri aawaaz me jadoo<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Mai qabr me gar apna ta'arruf na karata<br> maddah hu tera mai agar ye na batata<br> hoti na kabhi khatm malaek ki manu tu<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Wo sehne masiha hai ke hai sehen shifa ka<br> maine waha khud apni nigaho se hai dekha<br> zaer tera wa maut ko kar leta hai qaboo<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Haq aapki midhat ka ada kaise karu mai<br> kis tarha bhala dusra qur'an likhu mai<br> aati nahi jab mujhko abhi theek se urdu<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Mehsoos ye har baar mere dil ne kiya hai<br> maula tere darbaar ki taseer juda hai<br> hoti hai khushi aur kabhi aajate hai aasu<br> Ae zamin e ahoo..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Khul jaega duniya pe tere meer ka rutba<br> ho jaega maloom ke banda hu mai kiska<br> aegi meri qabr se jis dum teri khushbu</p> 
  <p>Ae zamin e ahoo..(6)</p> 
